---
import lightSvg from '../../assets/diagrams/redaction-light.svg?raw';
import darkSvg from '../../assets/diagrams/redaction-dark.svg?raw';
import Chart from './Chart.astro';
---

<Chart
  lightSvg={lightSvg}
  darkSvg={darkSvg}
  title="Before the fix, 69% of packets leaked a city and 35% leaked part of a name"
  caption="The after bars measure the newly built packets on disk; 505 live rows still rest on cached pre-fix reads until the re-run."
>
  Paired bars showing the share of saved packets that still contained identifying text. A piece of the applicant's own name: 35 percent before the fix, 6 percent after. A City, ST line: 69 percent before, 0 percent after.
</Chart>
